# Firebase web API key override (optional).
# If unset, the built-in fallback key inside src/firebase/firebase.js is used.
# To rotate the key: create a new key in Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials,
# then set it here and rebuild. Note: web API keys are public by design (they ship in the bundle);
# obfuscation does not protect them and cannot repair a revoked key.
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...